This project involves using data files consisting of information regarding historical wars and battles. 

I want to develop my own machine learning model using logistic regression to classify some sort of information. At the moment,
I have very minimal experience with implementing machine learning techniques in Python. As such, I will be starting with some of the
basics, such as importing datasets into Python using pandas, and then exploring different trends and/or patterns with the data.
I will create another text file consisting of a basic timeline of what I have acheived throughout this project's development.

Dataset Attribution:

The War Atlas (2026). The War Atlas Open Dataset (version 2026-07-03). https://thewaratlas.co/data